---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SearchVisualizer from '../../../components/algorithms/SearchVisualizer.vue';
---

<BaseLayout title="二分查找动画演示 - Demo Center" description="二分查找算法可视化演示：在有序数组中通过折半区间快速定位目标值，Java 代码同步高亮">
  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-10">
    <a href="/algorithms" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-accent-dark dark:text-accent hover:underline mb-6">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      返回算法列表
    </a>

    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="text-3xl">⚡</span>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">二分查找</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Binary Search · 折半缩小范围，高效查找</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">需有序</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">O(log n)</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(1) 空间</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <SearchVisualizer client:load algorithm="binary" initialArray={[2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 56, 72, 91]} target={23} />

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">核心思想</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          前提是数组<strong>必须有序</strong>。每次取当前搜索区间的中间元素与目标值比较：如果相等则命中；如果中间值小于目标值，说明目标在右半区间；否则在左半区间。通过不断折半，搜索区间迅速缩小。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">复杂度分析</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
            <thead class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-4 py-2 rounded-l-lg">情况</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2">时间复杂度</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2 rounded-r-lg">说明</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">最优</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">O(1)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">目标值恰好是中间元素</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">平均 / 最差</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">O(log n)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">每次区间减半，最多 log₂n 次</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">空间</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(1)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">只需维护 low、high、mid 三个指针</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">关键细节</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 space-y-1">
          <li>必须使用 <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono text-sm">mid = low + (high - low) / 2</code> 防止整数溢出</li>
          <li>循环条件是 <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono text-sm">low <= high</code>，不是 <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono text-sm">low < high</code></li>
          <li>缩小范围时，<code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono text-sm">low = mid + 1</code> 或 <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono text-sm">high = mid - 1</code>，避免死循环</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
